<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">BALUA YA PAULI KWA FILIPI - MAANDIKO GA KIMATU'MBI'. Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">AFILIPI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fili</para>
  <para style="toc2">Afilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Pauli kwa Afilipi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filipi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya Pauli kwa Afilipi</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli paabile muutabilwe aandike balua kwa aumini babaabile Filipi mumyaka ya 61 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu (1:13). Nsimu wo iu'bi'li'ka aabile Roma. Balua yi'no yaandikilwe kwa kanisa lyalibile nkati ya muyi wa Filipi. Mukitabu sa Makowe ga Atumilwe tuwesa kwiyi'gana makowe masene bu'kana na muyi wa Filipi. Filipi waai muyi nku'lu' wa nkoa wa Makedonia. Kai' ali' lyaabile kanisa lilongoi tumbwa munkoa wa Makedonia. Pauli na Sila pabaalitumbwile kanisa lyo babile pamope, na ata yingiyilwa nkati ya utabilwe kilo soti baabile nkati ya muyi wo (Makowe ga Atumilwe 16).</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwesa panga Pauli aabile na mabinio nsi'si' muuandiki wa balua yake. Aitumi balua yo kati lipala lya kwasukulu kwa upo yabaantumile bu'ka pabaayu'wine panga abi'kilwe muutabilwe. Kai' aawesite kwabakia bu'kana na ali yake abile muutabilwe, na ngaitumya balua yo kwapanga baatange ki Timoteo na Epafrodito kwa kanisa li'nga bawese kwakemya no isimu ulongosi wabe.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pauli atumbwa andika balua yake kwo salimia kanisa lyalibile kumuyi wa Filipi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Aabakia pandu nsi'si' muabali ya ali yainti'li'ta, na makowe gi'ngi' gaagabweni panga gendakunsuluya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:3-2:30">1:3-2:30</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Aawanikia makowe nsi'si' go bi'ngi'ya muutami wa maisa ga Kikilisitu kwa iyendo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3:1-4:9</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Pauli alisukulu likanisa lya Filipi kwa upo yabaantumile no piya salamu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 4:10-23">4:10-23</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Balua yi'no niandike nenga na Pauli, nibile pamope na Timoteo, ntumisi nnyangu' mu Kilisitu Yesu, nimwandikya mwabandu boti ba Nnu'ngu' akwo Filipi mwamulu'mbaniyilwe na Kilisitu Yesu, pamope na alongosi na ayangatiyi ba kanisa. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Tunnu'bya ngu'ngu' na amani bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu na kwa Bwana Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sala kwa bandu ba Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Kila paninku'mbu'kyanga ninsukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sinu. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Na kila paninnu'bya, nilu'ba kwa pulaa, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />kwa mwanjaa mwaniyangatiye kwibambiya Abali Inannoga, bu'ka pamwau'bi'lile mpaka nambi'yambi'. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Kakape nitangite panga, Nnu'ngu' ywalitumbwi lyengo li' linannoga nkati yinu alu'a yendelya kulipanga mpaka kulitimisa mulisu'ba lya abuya Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Nitangite panga mwaning'wasilya nga mwembe kwa mwanjaa masu'ba goti mubile papipi muno na mwoyo wangu'. Nnu'ngu' atupei ngu'ngu' yo panga kasi yake pamope, mana nibile muutabilwe, au kwa kwikengelya na kwikong'ondelya Abali Inannoga. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Nnu'ngu' nga nkong'ondeli wangu' panga nimpendangite muno kwa mwoyo wa upendo wa Yesu Kilisitu, na niminyikia bonagana na mwenga.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Ninnu'byanga kwa Nnu'ngu' panga upendo winu uyendeli yongekeya muno pamope na ikima na utangi woti, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />li'nga mukombwe sawa makowe gagabile manogau. Na apo ngapamwalu'a panga mwaapeleteu, pangali lukoolo lwolwoti mulisu'ba lyo buya Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Maisa ginu gaalu'a twi'lya iyendo ya aki yi'lu' yannyalyanga Yesu Kilisitu kwa utukupu na sipwa kwa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'su'mbu'lwa kwa Pauli kuyangatiye lyengo lya Bwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Bai mwaalongo bangu', mbala mutange panga makowe galu' gagaanipatike, kakape gaaniyangatiye muno kwibambiya Abali Inannoga. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Bu'kana na go ali'ndi'li boti ba nyumba ya nkulungwa na bi'ngi' boti batangite panga nibile muutabilwe kwa kitumbu sa kuntumikia Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Kwa kitumbu so tabilwa kwangu', alongo bambone bamwu'bi'li Bwana no kasana muno kulibambiya Liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' pangali yogopa. <verse eid="PHP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Kakape, bandu bi'ngi' bamwala Kilisitu kwa bwigu na bulwe, lakini bi'ngi' bamwala Kilisitu kwa mabinio ganannoga. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Aba bamwala Kilisitu kwa upendo, kwa mwanjaa batangite panga Nnu'ngu' anipei lyengo lya kwikengya Abali Inannoga. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Abo bi'ngi' bamwala Kilisitu kwa masindano na kwenda kwa mwoyo nng'olou lili, kabagania panga balu'a kuniyongekeya ngu'su'mbu' muutabilwe wangu'.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Lakini kili'beli, nenga nipulaika manaitei bandu bamwala Kilisitu kwa ndi'la mbali'mbali', ibe kwa ndi'la akau au ngolou. Kai', nilu'a yendelya pulaika, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />kwa mwanjaa nitangite panga kwa sala yinu na kwa uyangatiyi wa Loo wa Yesu Kilisitu, naalu'a kombolwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Nipi'kanilya kwa kilu'lu' muno no u'bi'lya panga niisikali kwa ndi'la yoyoti, ila nilu'a panga na ukangamau wo li'ngana nambi'yambi' kati nsimu wi'ngi' wowoti, Kilisitu akwi'yi'lwe muyi'ga yangu' ata manaitei kwo lama au kwo waa. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Kwa mwanjaa, kwangu' nenga lama nga kuntumikia Kilisitu, no waa nga pwaila muno. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Lakini manaitei yendelya lama mudunia, naalu'a kwibona itunda ya lyengo lyanipanga. Nambi'yambi' nitangiteli nisawe lyaku'. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Niutilwa na makowe gabi'li'. Niminyikia kugaleka maisa gano, nikatame na Kilisitu kwa mwanjaa li'no nga likowe lya mpu'ku'bi'la muno kwangu'. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Lakini likowe lya ngama kwinu, nenga niyendeli lama padunia. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Kwa mwanjaa nibile na ukakape bu'kana na likowe li'. Nenga nitangite panga nilu'a igala, no tama pamope na mwenga li'nga ninnyangatiange mupate ku'la no baa na pulaa muimani. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Bai, panalu'a ki'li'bu'kya kai' kasinu mwalu'a kwipuna muno kwa kitumbu sangu' kwo lu'mbana kwinu na Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Nnyendo winu ube wu'lu' waupalikwa mu Abali Inannoga ya Yesu Kilisitu. Apo, mana naisa kummona au mana naisali, nipala niyu'we panga muyendelya kangamala muimani no baa na umope kai', na mwaboti muku'mbwana ngondo kwa kitumbu sa imani yaibu'kana na Abali Inannoga. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Kanemwayogope andumu binu. Yi'no yapanga mwasu kwabe panga baalanganyika, lakini mwenga mwakosopolelwa, na li'no nga lyengo lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' ampei mwenga ngu'ngu' kwenda kwa kumwu'bi'lya Kilisitu baili, ila kai' ata kwo ku'su'mbu'lwa kwa kitumbu sake. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Mwaagabweni manonopau gambone ganikwembine nago, na mwendayu'wa panga balo kanikwembana nago. Nyinyonyo, namwenga mupalikwa kwembana nago.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Gegekeya na uku'lu' wa Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Buli, maisa ginu mu Kilisitu gampeyanga makakala? Buli, upendo wake unkamwa mboko? Buli, mubile na umope na Loo Mpeleteu no bi'kyana kiya no ku'ku'li'kyana mwabene na bene? <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Bai, muitimilise pulaa yangu' kwo baa na mabinio gamo, pendana mwabene na bene, muyu'wangane na muganiye gamo. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Kanemupange lyolyoti kwa kwikwi'ya wala kwipuna, ila kwo gegeya, kila mundu ammalangili nnyine panga ywa ngama kuliko mwene. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Kila yumo ywinu kaneaganiye makowe gake mwene baili, ila aganiye na makowe ga bi'ngi'. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Mube na mabinio gaagalu'galu' gaabile nago Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Bu'ka kwai'mbu' ywembe aabile kati mwabile Nnu'ngu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">lakini ku'lu' baa nsawani na Nnu'ngu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">aakibweni kili'be so pu'tu'lyana nasoli muno.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Ila ngalekekeya kila kili'be,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">na kwiuluya no panga kati ntumisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">ngabelekwa kuminyo ya mundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">kakape mundu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Aatigegekeya no yu'wa mpaka waa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:8">ata waa munsalaba!<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Kwa kitumbu so Nnu'ngu' amwu'bwiye Yesu kunani muno kuliko ili'be yoti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:9">ngaampeya lina liku'lu' lyalipi'ta maina goti,<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />li'nga kwa isima ya lina lya Yesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">yumbe yoti kunani, padunia na kumambi',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">ikilikite nnu'ngi' yake,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />na boti bayi'ki'ti panga Yesu Kilisitu nga Bwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:11">kwa utukupu wa Tati' Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bweya wa padunia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Kwa nyo mwaapendwa bangu', panaabile na mwenga kakape mwendeniyu'wa na ata nambi'yambi' panibaa kuutalu na mwenga muyongeye yu'wa muno. Muutimilise ukosopoli winu mwabene kwo lendema no yogopa. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' ngaywapanga kasi nkati yinu na kumpeya mwoyo wo penda timisa makowe gagannogelelya mwene.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Mupange makowe goti pangali ku'ku'li'ka wala taukana, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />li'nga mwapange mwabandu mwaapeleteu pangali lukoolo, bangali kipi'li' nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu', mwamutama mudunia akau na yaialabike. Mwalu'a melemetya pakati yabe kati ndondwa mwaimelemetya padunia. <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />Mulikamwe liyi'gi'yo lya ukoti, li'nga nipate kwipuna mulisu'ba lya Kilisitu panga binia kwangu' na kasi yangu' yaai yabuleli.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Ata ikatei naapiya maisa gangu' na myai yangu' yaayitanika kati salaka pamope na imani yinu yaipanga salaka nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu', nenga nalu'a pulaika, kai' naalu'a pulaika pamope na mwenga mwaboti. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Na mwenga nyinyonyo mupulaike kai' mupulaike pamope na nenga.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoteo na Epafrodito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Bwana Yesu mana apenda nipala kuntuma Timoteo aise kasinu nambi'yambi', li'nga paaki'li'bu'kya kasangu' nayi'yi'lwe mwoyo kwa kitumbu so yu'wa abali yinu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Nintuma ywembe kwa mwanjaa ntu'pu' mundu ywi'ngi' ywanku'mbu'kya mwenga kwa mwoyo woti kati Timoteo. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Kwa mwanjaa kila mundu aukilya muno makowe gake, na wala galu' ga kasi ya Yesu Kilisitu lili. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Mwenga mwabene mutangite mwailayite Timoteo panga ayi'ki'tilwe kwa mwanjaa apangite kasi ya Abali Inannoga pamope na nenga kati mwapanga mwana na tati' bake. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Kwa nyo niu'bi'lya kuntuma kasinu palu' panalu'a tanga makowe gangu' mwagaayendelya. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Nanenga nimwu'bi'lya Bwana panga nibile papipi no isa kunnola.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Lakini nibweni bola kai' kuntuma kwinu Epafrodito, nnongo wangu' na mpangakasi nnyangu' ywabile asikali nnyangu'. Ywembe ywo nga ywamwantumike kuniyangatia muupali wangu'. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Ywembe abile na kilu'lu' muno sa kummona mwaboti, kai' abile na kyukala kwa mwanjaa mwaayu'wine panga aabile ntamwe. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Eloo, aabile ntamwe papipi no waa. Lakini Nnu'ngu' ammi'ki kiya, na wala ywembe baili ila ata nenga aanibi'ki kiya li'nga kaneniusunike muno. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Kwa nyo nintuma kasinu kiyu'ngu'ya, li'nga pamwalu'a kummona kai' mwapate pulaika, na nenga kyukala sangu' saalu'a pu'ngwa. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Kwa nyo mumpoki mu Bwana kwa pulaa ngu'lu' na mwenga mwapei isima bandu bababile kati ywo, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />kwa mwanjaa ywembe aabile papipi no waa kwa kitumbu sa kasi ya Kilisitu. Aagabi'i maisa gake mmaule kwa kitumbu sa kuniyangatia galu' gangalikombwa mwenga kuniyangatia.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Ikima ya kakape</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Kwa nyo mwaalongo bangu', mupulaike kwa mwanjaa mwenga mwabake Bwana. Nitotokelwali ki'li'bu'kya kumwandikya galu' ganaamwandikile patumbu, kwa mwanjaa gali'ndi'la imani. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Mwili'ndi'le na balu' babapanga malau, abo mapwa, mwili'ndi'le na balu' babakong'ondelya kwikata yi'ga yabe. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Bandu babainilwe kwa kakape nga twenga, kwenda bembeli, kwa mwanjaa twenga tunkilikitya Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya Loo wake na kwibona kinemi kwo lu'mbana na Kilisitu Yesu. Twenga tubi'kali liu'bi'lyo litu mumakowe ga kiyi'ga. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Nenga namwene nilu'e wesa baa na kitumbu sa kwiu'bi'lya yi'ga. Manaitei mundu ywoywoti ywakita abile na kitumbu sa kwiu'bi'lya yi'ga, nenga nga kimuno. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Nainilwe lisu'ba lya nane bu'ka belekwa kwangu', nenga na Mwisilaili wa lukolo lwa Benyamini, na Mwebrania wa kweli. Kwa abali ya salya naai na Falisayo. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Naabile namundu ywapenda muno kunnyu'wa Nnu'ngu' ata nganiliku'su'mbwa kanisa. Na kwo bu'kana na aki yaipatikana kwa kwikamwa salya, nenga naabileli na likosa lyolyoti. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Lakini makowe goti gagaabile ga pwaila kasangu' nambi'yambi' nigabalangilya kili'beli kwa kitumbu sa Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Bu'ka pa ago goti, nibalanga panga makowe goti kili'beli kanilandanisa na pwaila ngu'lu' munomuno ya kuntanga Kilisitu Yesu Bwana wangu'. Kwa kitumbu sake niyi'ki'ti obeya goti, kanibalanga panga kati mmai li'nga kumpata Kilisitu, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />no lu'mbana nakwe kabisa. Na nenga nibalangilwali aki kai' bu'kana na makowe ganigapangite, ago nga galu' ga aki yaipatikana kwa kwikamwa salya. Lakini nibalangilwa aki kwa ndi'la ya kumwu'bi'lya Kilisitu, nga yi'lu' aki yaibu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' na ywembe ammalangilya aki yu'lu' ywamwu'bi'lya. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Kili'be sanikipala muno nga kuntanga Kilisitu na uweso waunnyu'yite bu'ka mukiwo. Nipange kiselele mungu'su'mbu' yake no landana nakwe mukiwo sake, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />kaniu'bi'lya panga na nenga nalu'a yu'yi'lwa bu'ka mukiwo.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kasana li'nga kumabinio gitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Niipunali panga niyomwike sinda au nikamilike. Lakini nendakasana li'nga nipate kulikamwa li'lu' kwa kitumbu sake Yesu Kilisitu anikamwile na kunipanga naywake. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Mwaalongo bangu', niibalangali panga niyomwike ika. Ila nilipanga likowe limo bai, nigalibalya makowe gagapite, no kasana kugapanga wiso makowe gagabile nnu'ngi' yangu'. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Niyendelya kasana li'nga kuundi'la nipate sinda no peyelwa upo yangu'. Nnu'ngu' mwene anikemite pata upo yo yingya kunani kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Twenga twaboti twatukomile muimani, tupalikwa tuganiye gamo. Na mana abile yumo nkati yinu ywagania mbali', Nnu'ngu' alu'a kumwumukulya makowe go. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Pano kili'be sa ngama, tuyendeli kugakamwa galu' gatubile nago.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Mwaalongo bangu', muniyige nenga na kwiyi'gana kwa balu' babatama kati mwatulayite kasinu. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Kwa nyo kati mwanammakiye mala yambone na nenga nambi'yambi' nibaya kai' kwa moli, bandu baingi batama kati andumu ba nsalaba wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Kuundi'la yabe langanyika, kwa mwanjaa itumbo yabe nga nnu'ngu' wabe, baibona kinemi bu'kana na makowe gabe ga oni, na bagania makowe ga padunia bai. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Lakini twenga nga twabenekaya ba kunani na tunni'nda Nkomboli witu Bwana Yesu Kilisitu aise bu'ka kunani. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Ywembe aaigalambuya yi'ga yitu ya ukigopi na kwipanga ilandane na yi'ga yake ya utukupu, kwa makakala galu' gagakombwa kwibi'ka ili'be yoti pai' ya utawala wake.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Malagyo mbali'mbali'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Kwa nyo, mwaalongo bangu' mwanimpendile, nibile na kilu'lu' so bonagana na mwenga, mwamubile pulaa yangu' na upo yangu' ya usindi yanaapokya. Pano pabile ninnu'banga muyendeli yi'ma kwo kangamala kwa kumwu'bi'lya Bwana.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Euodia na Sintike sonde, ninnu'ba mutame kwo yu'wangana nnu'ngi' ya Bwana. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Na wenga wantumisi nnyangu' wauu'bi'like, nikulu'ba wayangatiye akinamau' bo, kwa mwanjaa baapangite lyengo lyo bambiya Abali Inannoga kwo kasana pamope na nenga, Klementi na apangakasi ayangu', babaandikilwe maina gabe mukitabu sa bandu bake Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Bai, mupulaikange kwa Bwana masu'ba goti, kai' nibaya mupulaikange. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Liya kwinu kutanganikwe kwa bandu boti, kwa mwanjaa buya kwa Bwana kwegelile. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Kanemwiauye kwa likowe lyolyoti, ila kwa kila kili'be kwo lu'ba Nnu'ngu' no sali no sukulu, gamugalu'ba gatanganikwe na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Nayembe amani ya Nnu'ngu' yaipi'ta lunda lwoti lwa bandu, yalu'a li'ndi'la myoyo yinu na maganio ginu muulu'mbani winu na Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Kuundi'la mwaalongo bangu' mubini kugagania makowe goti gagabile ga kweli, ga isima, ga aki, gangali ulau, go nogelelya, gagapendelwa longelelwa, na go lumbilwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Mugapange galu' gamwiyi'ganiye na kugapokya bu'ka kasangu', galu' gamuyu'wine kanigabaya na kugabona kanigapanga. Naywembe Nnu'ngu' ywatuyalya amani aalu'a baa pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sukulu kwa upo ya Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Nitepulaika muno kwa Bwana, kwa mwanjaa mulayite kai' panga mwendaniku'mbu'kya. Mwayendeli kuniku'mbu'kya, lakini yaabile ntu'pu' ndi'la yo laya likowe li'no. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Nimmakianga gano kwenda kwa mwanjaa nipala yangatiyilwa na ywoywotili, kwa mwanjaa niiyi'ganiye li'ngana na sosoti sanibile naso. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Nitangite oya na ata meya. Niiyi'ganiye iyo yo yi'ki'tyana na kila ali, yukuta au njala, nsimu wo meya au nsimu wo oya. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Nikombwa kugayi'ki'tya makowe goti kwa ywembe ywaniyi'ya makakala. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Ata nyo mwaapangite kinannoga kwo panga kiselele pamope na nenga mutabu yangu'.<verse eid="PHP 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Bu'ka pa ago mwenga mwabandu ba Filipi mutangite panga masu'ba ganaatumbwi ala Abali Inannoga panaabu'i Makedonia, mwenga kisinu nga likanisa lyaliniyangatiye mumakowe go piya no pokya. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Kwa mwanjaa ata panaabile Tesalonike mwaniyangatiye mala yambone bu'kana na makowe ganigapala. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Kwenda nenga nipala nipoki upoli, ila nipala pwaila iyongekeyelwe mumabi'ko ginu. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Nibile na kila kili'be sanikipala. Kai' nibile na yo pi'ti'li'ki'ya yaniipalage kwa mwanjaa, Epafrodito anileti kila samwampeile. Upo yinu ibile kati salaka yene lumba lunannungya yaipiyilwa kwa Nnu'ngu', nga salaka yaiyi'ki'tya na yainnogelelya. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Bai, kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu, Nnu'ngu' wangu' aalu'a timilisa goti gamugapala, bu'kana na uyolou wa utukupu wa utayili wake. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Utukupu ube kwa Nnu'ngu' witu na Tati' bitu, milele na milele. Amina!<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu ya kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Nendakunsalimia mwaapeleteu boti, mwamubile mwabake Kilisitu Yesu. Alongo boti bababile pamope na nenga pano bendakunsalimiyanga. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Na apeleteu boti bababile pano bendakunsalimiyanga, munomuno balu' babatama munyumba ya Kaisali.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Ngu'ngu' ya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu ibe pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>